@startuml administration-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (administration-service) - FR-20\nOwner: Muhammed Hany Hamdy
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IAdministration <<provided>> {
  +searchStudents(query): List<Account>
  +createAccount(data): Account
  +updateAccount(id, data): Account
  +suspendAccount(id): void
  +getStatistics(): UsageStats
  +getRetention(): List<RetentionPoint>
  +resolveIssue(issueId): void
}

class AdministrationService <<component>> {
  -studentProfile: IStudentProfile
  -repository: IAccountRepository
  -statisticsCalculator: StatisticsCalculator
  --
  +searchStudents(...) / createAccount(...)
  +updateAccount(...) / suspendAccount(...)
  +getStatistics(...) / getRetention(...)
  +resolveIssue(...)
}

IAdministration <|.. AdministrationService
class StatisticsCalculator <<component>> {
  +usage(): UsageStats
  +retention(): List<RetentionPoint>
}
AdministrationService --> StatisticsCalculator

interface IStudentProfile <<required - Student service>> {
  +createProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +updateProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +getProfile(studentId): Profile
  +getAvailability(studentId): List<TimeSlot>
}

AdministrationService --> IStudentProfile
interface IAccountRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Account): void
  +findById(id): Account
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Account>
}

AdministrationService --> IAccountRepository
class Account {
  -accountId: String
  -name: String
  -email: String
  -status: String
  --
  +suspend(): void
}
class AccountIssue {
  -issueId: String
  -accountId: String
  -status: String
}
class UsageStats {
  -registered: int
  -active30d: int
  -featureUsage: Map
}
IAccountRepository --> Account
Account "1" -- "0..*" AccountIssue
note bottom of AdministrationService
SOLID applied:
S - AdministrationService only coordinates; StatisticsCalculator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing AdministrationService.
L - AdministrationService can replace any other IAdministration implementation.
I - IAdministration has only the operations its clients use.
D - AdministrationService depends on interfaces (IStudentProfile, IAccountRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
